            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You can create bigger snares for quick deployment, making it more likely for a creature to walk into your snares.\n\nWhen you prepare snares for quick deployment, you can prepare some of them as giant snares. A giant snare takes up a 10-foot-by-10-foot area but costs two of your quick deployment snares. A giant snare can trigger from a creature entering any portion of its area, and all its effects apply over the full area."
            }
          }
